    (15739,'You... WHAT?$B$BCome over here and say that!$B$B<Kristoff kicks and flails his limbs in a frothing rage, his head twisting around to glare at you.>$B$BSo help me, I will - I am going to - I will knock your brains out! I will fill the empty cavity left behind with my boot! Come here! GET BACK HERE!$B$B<Kristoff strains to grasp your neck, his fingers wriggling inches from your face.>','',0,1,0,5,0,15,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,15595),
