    (16432,'The excitement of the crowd, the thrill of the fight - you should have seen it!  Ever since those ogres took control of the Dire Maul arena, I\'ve been forced to camp out here.  Griniblix the Spectator - ha!  Spectator of what?  This campfire?  That shrub?  Or how about this odd purple tree?,
